{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Akhen</b>: Let His people not despair because of the length of the exile, for the salvation is near — if Israel return to fear HaShem, then HaShem will turn from His wrath, to dwell His glory in their midst. This <b>akhen</b> [means] near. And behold, this psalm is testimony that the glory was not in the Second Temple."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 85, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:05.181806306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}